  },
  {
    "en": "Spread bolts over crowds exactly.",
    "to": "敵の群れにボルトを正確に配ろう。"
  },
  {
    "en": "Scheduling, bin packing, interval problems.",
    "to": "スケジュール、箱詰め、区間の問題。"
  },
  {
    "en": "Enumerator",
    "to": "列挙（れっきょ）"
  },
  {
    "en": "Brute-force sources make bolts with +1 power; a volley may hold 192 bolts.",
    "to": "総当たりの生成カードは、ボルトの威力が1上がる。一斉射は192本まで持てる。"
  },
  {
    "en": "Floods of hundreds of bolts.",
    "to": "何百本ものボルトで押し切ろう。"
  },
  {
    "en": "Combinatorics and growing search spaces.",
    "to": "組み合わせと、探索する空間の広がり。"
  },
  {
    "en": "Pruner",
    "to": "枝刈り"
  },
  {
    "en": "A program never times out: the card that would cross the budget is skipped instead, and later cards still run.",
    "to": "制限時間を超えそうなカードだけ飛ばし、次のカードを実行する。時間切れにならない。"
  },
  {
    "en": "Exhaustive cards safely near the budget.",
    "to": "制限時間ぎりぎりまで、安全に総当たりしよう。"
  },
  {
    "en": "Pruning, branch and bound, graceful degradation.",
    "to": "枝刈り、分枝限定、無理なく続ける工夫。"
  },
  {
    "en": "Overclocker",
    "to": "オーバークロッカー"
  },
  {
    "en": "The budget is 50% larger; a timeout costs 5 Integrity.",
    "to": "制限時間が50%増える。時間切れになるとHPを5失う。"
  },
  {
    "en": "The slowest, heaviest programs, all risk.",
    "to": "遅くて重いプログラムに、リスクをかけよう。"
  },
  {
    "en": "Quadratic code and the limits of more hardware.",
    "to": "二乗で増える仕事量と、計算機を増やす限界。"
  },
  {
    "en": "Memoiser",
    "to": "メモ化"
  },
  {
    "en": "functools.cache is in force from the first turn: a card that already ran this fight does no work.",
